				"OnTrigger" "player,$DisplayTextChat,{FFB4B4}⋧t ⣘s po⿵⣍i⼌⿀e t⩤at a pa⫇sing erⷺor ⌃ad ▔c⋚ured. Check c⼢nso⣶e for deta≀⎋s,5,-1"
